<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/CSZV> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, silty, gravelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/CSZVB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, sandy, silty, gravelly, bouldery [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
