<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GDP> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite, porphyritic"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GDTN> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granodiorite, tonalitic"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GGNR> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granitic-rock, gneissose"@en .
