<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GLCL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, glauconitic"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GLIG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Glassy-igneous-rock - A type of fine-grained normal crystalline rock. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06."@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GLMDST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone, glauconitic"@en .
