<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GNSH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Granite, sheared"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/GNSKA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gneiss, k-feldspar-augen"@en .
