<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/MDST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mudstone - An argillaceous sedimentary rock based on grain size or crystal size. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/03, fig. 13. See: silicate-mudstone."@en .
