<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/MTRDA> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Metatrachydacite"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/MTRNT> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Metatrachyandesite (TAS) [Unnecessary term: use MTRAND]"@en .
