<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/SZCVH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sand, silty, clayey, gravelly, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/SZH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sand, silty, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended]"@en .
