<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/VCSST> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Volcaniclastic-sandstone - A type of volcaniclastic-sedimentary-rock. British Geological Survey Research Report RR/99/06, section 4.2 and fig. 4. See also: sandstone."@en .
