<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/VZSLB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gravel, silty, sandy, cobbly, bouldery [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme]"@en .
