<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XCVH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, gravelly, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use CVH]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XCVSH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Clay, gravelly, sandy, shelly [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use CVSH]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XFIS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Fine-sand [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use FIS]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XH> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Shells [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] - A type of natural superficial deposit. The Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended is an extension to the Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme, for deposit types not defined in the original scheme. [Obsolete code: use H]"@en .
