<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XHSZ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Shells, sandy, silty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use HSZ]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XHZ> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Shells, silty [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use HZ]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XM> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mud [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] - A type of natural superficial deposit. The Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended is an extension to the Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme, for deposit types not defined in the original scheme. [Obsolete code: use M]"@en .
<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/EarthMaterialClass/RockName/XMES> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Medium-sand [Unlithified Deposits Coding Scheme - Extended] [Obsolete code: use MES]"@en .
